SUMMARY:Full Moon Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**New Venue!**\n\n**Come and join us for 
 a Strawberry Full Moon ceremony at our new home in Nebo\, NC.**\n\n**I’m
  Shaman Phil (Munay-Ki lineage) and have been hosting full moon ceremonies
  at our old home in Alexandria\, VA and now our new home in the mountains 
 of western North Carolina.**\n\n**During this outside ceremony I will invi
 te the spirits and guides to join us as we start an evening fire. We will 
 have a comfortable meditation and some manifestations and intention settin
 g for embracing the Full moon cycle to a drum beat.**\n\n**We will partici
 pate in a healing meditation. This is very powerful and quite healing. We 
 will go on a Shamanic journey\, often a past life regression or soul retri
 eval journey (my guides don’t tell me until the day before and is usuall
 y dependent on who is coming).**\n\n**We might do a quick cord cutting alo
 ng with intension setting.**\n\n**We will be sharing and discussing some t
 hought-provoking questions. I recommend bringing a journal to record your 
 thoughts.**\n\n**We can share some stories around the fire and then I will
  close the ceremony.**\n\n**Bring appropriate crystals that you would like
  charged. The best crystals to charge during a full moon are amethyst\, sm
 oky quartz\, citrine\, black selenite\, and obsidian. We will be outside o
 n a patio in the woods so please dress for the conditions.**\n\n**This is 
 a laid-back event at our home\, I hope that you can join us!**\n\n**We hav
 e street parking\, and it is not a busy street. You will need a gate code 
 to get in.**\n\n**See you then!**\n**Shaman Phil**
